  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2402.01 Requests. A person may request a copy of the unified carrier registration agreement by contacting the department at the following address:\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nATTN: Road Toll Administration\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03305\n\nSource. #1912, eff 1-11-82; ss by #2607, eff 1-31-84, EXPIRED 1-31-90 (formerly Saf-P 702.01)\n\nNew. #4892, eff 7-31-90; ss by #6210, eff 3-22-96, EXPIRED: 3-22-04\n\nNew. #9718, eff 5-27-10; ss by #12579, eff 7-20-18",
